John is here in the audience.

00:38:12.170 --> 00:38:14.000
It's helped a lot
of my major apps.

00:38:14.000 --> 00:38:15.590
So if you're doing
interactive visuals

00:38:15.590 --> 00:38:20.900
and need both the more standard
type of statistical displays

00:38:20.900 --> 00:38:24.990
but also some really novel
displays, it's got you covered.

00:38:24.990 --> 00:38:27.617
So I highly recommend
that as well.

00:38:27.617 --> 00:38:29.450
Great, thanks, and
nice to meet you, Eric.

00:38:29.450 --> 00:38:30.380
Appreciate that.

