00:38:52.290 --> 00:38:54.040
And I've worked at
smaller companies, too,

00:38:54.040 --> 00:38:55.840
that have used those as--

00:38:55.840 --> 00:39:00.430
sort of led with those
as their Bi offerings.

00:39:00.430 --> 00:39:07.328
It's interesting to think about
how Shiny or Connect plays

00:39:07.328 --> 00:39:08.870
a role with those
things because it's

00:39:08.870 --> 00:39:10.910
easy to-- and I've
played a role,

00:39:10.910 --> 00:39:14.640
and it's easy to get into like,
