00:56:02.590 --> 00:56:05.487
so just want to double-check.

00:56:05.487 --> 00:56:07.070
One other thing
I'll say while we're

00:56:07.070 --> 00:56:10.220
waiting on that is what I'd
love to see in the next year

00:56:10.220 --> 00:56:13.390
is more Quarto
Revealjs presentations.

00:56:13.390 --> 00:56:17.580
It's very cool, very innovative.

00:56:17.580 --> 00:56:20.750
Something similar was available
with ioslides a while ago,

00:56:20.750 --> 00:56:22.970
but, obviously, this
approach with Quarto

00:56:22.970 --> 00:56:26.900
is a little bit superior.

00:56:26.900 --> 00:56:30.590
So that becomes-- like, if
