00:56:30.590 --> 00:56:35.420
and business presentations, like
having to copy and paste stuff

00:56:35.420 --> 00:56:37.460
into PowerPoint,
even though I know

00:56:37.460 --> 00:56:39.090
Quarto can output
PowerPoint now too,

00:56:39.090 --> 00:56:44.870
but I would love to see
those types of presentations

00:56:44.870 --> 00:56:50.870
have a greater presence in
terms of data science delivery.

00:56:50.870 --> 00:56:52.990
I was actually just
talking with somebody

00:56:52.990 --> 00:56:56.410
on our open source team
yesterday about this Quarto

00:56:56.410 --> 00:57:01.120
Revealjs because he was
thinking of a conference talk

00:57:01.120 --> 00:57:03.710
that he wanted to submit.

00:57:03.710 --> 00:57:05.920
And so I would love
to hear from you,

00:57:05.920 --> 00:57:09.030
what would you like
to see for that?

00:57:09.030 --> 00:57:11.640
Would you like to see
templates, or what?

00:57:11.640 --> 00:57:14.013
The first thing I--

00:57:14.013 --> 00:57:15.555
yeah, templates,
and I know there's--

00:57:18.090 --> 00:57:22.020
people are constantly adding
to the assets available there,

00:57:22.020 --> 00:57:26.470
but I just remember the first
thing when that got announced,

00:57:26.470 --> 00:57:28.420
I immediately checked
if it could support

00:57:28.420 --> 00:57:30.430
HTML widgets because that
was the reason I went

00:57:30.430 --> 00:57:34.300
to ioslides a while ago instead
of RStudio Presentation that

00:57:34.300 --> 00:57:38.350
was built in, because when I've
showed people that, oh, here's

00:57:38.350 --> 00:57:41.980
a table with 400 rows,
but you can see 10, 25,

00:57:41.980 --> 00:57:44.620
or 100, or however many you want
at a time and page through it,

00:57:44.620 --> 00:57:51.985
versus just a Microsoft Office
table embedded into a thing.

00:57:51.985 --> 00:57:53.240
That really blew their mind.

00:57:53.240 --> 00:57:56.620
So I'd ask just
continuous support

00:57:56.620 --> 00:58:00.190
for the different
visualizations, especially

00:58:00.190 --> 00:58:03.100
the more JavaScript
interactive ones that can

00:58:03.100 --> 00:58:06.160
